@Floor1East1Storage_Employee_questActive
  +setConversation(Ada)
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
  +panCameraRelativeToPlayer(-50, 50)
  Employee: "Oh, hello."
  Employee: "You got a password for me?"
  +awaitChoice('"Fooza".', '"Blarg".', '"Zoofa".', 'I do not have a password.')
  Ada: "<cascade-letters>{lastChoiceText}..."
  +?lt(lastChoiceIndex, 2):{
    +playSound(terminal_cancel)
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    Employee: "Wrong answer.  I gotta kick you outta here."
    +:smirk(Employee)
    Employee: "Gotta take a little tax too for my time."
    +walkToMarker(Employee, MarkerWalkEmployee)
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
    +:floor1-transitionToEast1FromEast1Storage()
    +setConversation(Ada)
    +modifyTickets(-5)
  }
  +?eq(lastChoiceIndex, 2):{
    +playSound(terminal_beep)
    +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
    Employee: "Yeah, that's right.  You can come in."
    Ada: "Who are you?  An employee?"
    Employee: "Yeah.  Just chillin' back here for now."
    Employee: "Sometimes you lose a couple of bets, sometimes you're down on your luck.  Somebody's gotta do storage duty."
    +:shakeZ(Ada)
    +setFacing(Ada, left)
    Ada: "What is this place?"
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    Employee: "Eh it's just a simple room."
    +:ld(Employee, leftdown)
    Employee: "<scale=0.75 />With an alternate entrance."
    +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
    Employee: "Not that important of a place, honestly."
    Employee: "Maybe sometimes people come in here to buy things.  Maybe they just want a break.  It really depends on how you heard about it."
    +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
    +:question(Employee)
    Employee: "Anyway you said you wanted something?"
    +:grumpy(Ada)
    Ada: "<cascade-letters>......"
    +:shakeZ(Ada)
    Ada: "Yes."
    Ada: "I require <color=LIGHTBLUE>Ping Pong Equipment</>.  Do you have that in here?"
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    +:smirk(Employee)
    Employee: "Honey, this is back room storage.  I could find <italic>almost anything</> you want.  Provided of course, that you give me enough compensation."
    +:teardrop(Ada)
    Ada: "<cascade-letters>Okay,</> what do you want?"
    +setFacing(Employee, down)
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    Employee: "Well, you might have noticed I'm not wearing the officially-sanctioned <color=LIGHTBLUE>Regem Ludos Vest</>."
    +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
    +:smallPause()
    Employee: "I kinda lost it this morning. It got stuck in the elevator shaft somewhere.  Anyway I'm sure it's gone."
    Employee: "Problem is, they don't like it when an employee is walkin' around the floor without that particular vest."
    Ada: "When you say <italic>they</> who are you referring to?"
    Employee: "You know. <italic cascade-letters> The bosses</>.  The powers that be.  The OWNERS."
    Employee: "They come around from time to time and you better be sure to be on your best behavior around them, or else."
    +:sad(Employee)
    Employee: "The last guy who lost his vest wasn't as lucky as me.  Us employees <italic>still</> don't know what happened to him."
    Ada: "<cascade-letters>That is... slightly disturbing."
    +:shakeZ(Ada)
    Ada: "<scale=0.75 />Assuming your're joking around. </>You want me to find a vest for you?"
    Ada: "Where am I supposed to acquire this <color=LIGHTBLUE>employee vest</>?"
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    Employee: "I mean, I wasn't really gonna ask how you got one.  If you had to 'permanently borrow' one, then that's your business."
    Employee: "But if you're not that kind of girl, then you might find it more difficult."
    Ada: "I can assure you, I am not <italic>that kind of girl."
    +:sigh(Employee)
    Employee: "Well, I bet somebody out there is sellin' it."
    Employee: "Just keep lookin' around, I'm sure you'll find it somewhere."
    Employee: "Maybe you should ask whoever told you about this room?"
    +:teardrop(Ada)
    Ada: "Look, I do not really have <italic>time</> for this."
    Ada: "Somebody named <color=YELLOW>Callico</> told me about this place.  She said you owe here a favor?"
    +:smirk(Employee)
    Employee: "This <italic delay=100>is</> the favor.  The fact that I let you in should have clued you."
    +:flat(Ada)
    Ada: "Can I just have the <color=LIGHTBLUE>Ping Pong Equipment</> and then bring you a vest when I come back?"
    Employee: "You mean, <italic>if</> you come back."
    Employee: "Listen, hun, I wasn't born yesterday.  You look like the type to fleece a toddler."
    +:angry(Ada)
    Ada: "Excuse me!?"
    +stopSkipCutscene()
    Employee: "Just do what I ask and I'll get you your ping pong stuff.  Gotta build some trust if you expect to be trusted, you know?"
    Employee: "That's my <cascade-letters>deal</>, take it or leave it."
    +:angry(Ada)
    Ada: "If anyone is doing the <italic>fleecing</> here, it is you."
    +:happy(Employee)
    Employee: "Run along now.  You said yourself that you are in a hurry."
    +setFacing(Ada, rightup)
    +:grumpy(Ada)
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
    +completeQuestStep(PingPong, 5)
  }
  +?eq(lastChoiceIndex, 3):{
    +:shakeZ(Employee)
    Employee: "Well, at least you're honest."
    +:smirk(Employee)
    Employee: "I gotta kick you out anyway, though."
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
    +:floor1-transitionToEast1FromEast1Storage()
  }
  +endConversation()
@Floor1East1Storage_Employee_questActiveCheckEmployeeVest
  +completeQuestStep(PingPong, 8)
  +lookAtEachOther(Ada, Employee)
  +setConversation(Ada)
  +:shakeZ(Employee)
  Employee: "Oh, hello."
  +none()
