  Employee: "Anyway, <italic>a deal is a deal</>, as my old boss always said."
  Employee: "I asked around and managed to get some <color=LIGHTBLUE>Ping Pong Equipment</>.  I've got it right here."
  +walkToOffset(Employee, 16, 0)
  +walkToCharacter(Employee, Ada, 0, 16)
