  Ada: "I cannot help but notice you both are wearing some distinctive hats."
  floor2South_MerchantryGirl1: "If you're part of the <italic>club</> then you might get one."
  floor2South_MerchantryGirl2: "But don't expect an easy entry, of course."
  Ada: "Somebody approached me earlier wearing the same thing."
  Ada: "Her name was <color=YELLOW>Callico</>."
  Ada: "She offered to help me find some <color=LIGHTBLUE>Ping Pong Equipment</>."
  +:leach(floor2South_MerchantryGirl2, floor2South_MerchantryGirl1)
